{
  "_id": "qbZxZ7QbwTJJCawl",
  "name": "石匠戰鎬 Stonemaker War Pick (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "68",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>武器（戰鎬），極珍稀（需同調）<br />你用這把魔法戰鎬發動的攻擊檢定與其傷害擲骰具有+1加值。且它具有以下的特殊屬性：<br /></p><ul style=\"MARGIN:0px auto\"><li><p><strong>融身入石Meld into Stone。</strong>你可以用這把戰鎬施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.pJ6hE8Vab5Ypuqm4]{融身入石 Meld into Stone}</em>。一旦此屬性被使用，直到次日黎明前不能被再次使用。</p></li><li><p><strong>石化Petrification。</strong>這把戰鎬具有[[/r 1d6 + 1]]發充能。如果你對一個生命值不滿100點的生物擲出了一次重擊，你可以消耗1發充能，迫使該生物通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免。豁免失敗時，生物將陷入 <strong>石化Petrified</strong> 狀態，持續8小時。當戰鎬的充能數歸零後，它失去這條屬性。</p></li></ul><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic war pick. It has the following special properties:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Meld into Stone\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Meld into Stone.</span> You can cast the @spell[Meld into Stone] spell from this war pick. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Petrification\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Petrification.</span> The war pick has [[/r 1d6 + 1]] charges. If you score a critical hit against a creature that has fewer than 100 hit points, you can expend 1 charge from the war pick to have that creature make a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw. On a failed save, the creature has the petrified condition for 8 hours. When the war pick has no charges remaining, it loses this property.</p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
